    "created_at": "2020-08-31T18:18:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-31T18:18:20Z",
    "body": "That only applies to \"classic worker scripts.\" [Module scripts' mode defaults to \"`cors`\".](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#fetch-a-single-module-script)\r\n\r\nBut that confusion is understandable and further reason to prefer addressing the mode in HTML--setting the mode to \"same-origin\" isn't always necessary in Service Workers' \"perform the fetch\" algorithm.",
